# Vercel builds the Next.js app at the repo root only.
# These are separate services, deployed elsewhere:
#   backend/  -> FastAPI, runs on Render/Railway (Vercel cannot host it)
#   my-bot/   -> Cloudflare Worker, deployed with `wrangler deploy`
# Excluding them stops Vercel's multi-service detector guessing, and
# keeps the upload small.
backend/
my-bot/
BUILD-NOTES.md
